                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Derail Valley is an incredible game to have if you love driving trains![/h1]\n\nI've played the campaign on realistic difficulty from the start. It is a very rewarding experience to get better and more comfortable driving the locomotives as you progress and unlock the new licenses. Now, after nearly 200 hours of playing, and having many millions of dollars in my in-game wallet, I still find myself coming back daily to haul freight around.\n\nThe gameplay [i]can[/i] be punishing and unforgiving with a steep learning curve when playing on the realistic settings. But it is incredibly rewarding and satisfying as you begin to master each locomotive and develop a real skill for driving these trains.\n\nDerail Valley is a passion project of the developers who are continuing to work hard behind the scenes, and I am very excited for the future of this game.\n\n[b]I love this game!![/b] \nI have 200 hours in the base game and I haven't even modded it yet lol",
